  "name": "Wind Soul",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You gain Immunity to lightning and thunder damage.</p><p>You also gain a magical Fly Speed of 60 feet. As an Action, you can choose a number of creatures within 30 feet of you equal to 3 + your Charisma modifier and grant them a Fly Speed of 60 feet for 1 hour. Once you use this feature, you can't do so again until you finish a Short or a Long Rest or until you spend 5 Sorcery Points to use it again..</p>",
